hints.pseudocode:
current = 1; k = k - 1
while k > 0:
  size = how many numbers <= n start with current   (count level by level: [c, c], [10c, 10c + 9], [100c, 100c + 99], ... cut at n)
  if size <= k: k -= size; current += 1       (skip the whole subtree)
  else: current *= 10; k -= 1                  (go to the first child)
return current
